2026-10-20T13:23:33.6700370Z To enable PHP in Apache add the following to httpd.conf and restart Apache:
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6701110Z     LoadModule php_module /opt/homebrew/opt/php@8.4/lib/httpd/modules/libphp.so
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6711210Z 
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6711410Z     <FilesMatch \.php$>
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6712550Z         SetHandler application/x-httpd-php
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6716350Z     </FilesMatch>
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6718080Z 
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6718660Z Finally, check DirectoryIndex includes index.php
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6719520Z     DirectoryIndex index.php index.html
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6719820Z 
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6720320Z The php.ini and php-fpm.ini file can be found in:
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6724470Z     /opt/homebrew/etc/php/8.4/
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6725360Z 
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6727810Z To start php@8.4 now and restart at login:
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6750710Z   brew services start php@8.4
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6762840Z Or, if you don't want/need a background service you can just run:
2026-10-20T13:23:33.6763430Z   /opt/homebrew/opt/php@8.4/sbin/php-fpm --nodaemonize
